          "prompt": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>Let x, y be integer numbers. Choose the propositional function P(x, y) such that<br/>$\\forall x \\exists y\\, P(x,y) = F$ and $\\exists x \\exists y\\, P(x,y) = T$.<br/>(i) $P(x,y) = \\text{\"}x^2+y^2=5\\text{\"}$<br/>(ii) $P(x,y) = \\text{\"}x^2+y=5\\text{\"}$<br/>(iii) $P(x,y) = \\text{\"}x^2+y^2=-5\\text{\"}$<br/>(iv) $P(x,y) = \\text{\"}x^2+y=-5\\text{\"}$</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Cho x, y là số nguyên. Chọn hàm mệnh đề P(x, y) sao cho<br/>$\\forall x \\exists y\\, P(x,y) = F$ và $\\exists x \\exists y\\, P(x,y) = T$.<br/>(i) $P(x,y) = \\text{\"}x^2+y^2=5\\text{\"}$<br/>(ii) $P(x,y) = \\text{\"}x^2+y=5\\text{\"}$<br/>(iii) $P(x,y) = \\text{\"}x^2+y^2=-5\\text{\"}$<br/>(iv) $P(x,y) = \\text{\"}x^2+y=-5\\text{\"}$</p></div>",
